   └─ see: rhx grove.backup.restore --help

## two units named
rc=2
✋ ConstraintError: name exactly one of: --all · --of <org/repo> --tree <dir> · --of <org/repo> --setaside <name> · --orphan <org>/<dir> · --home <dir>
   └─ see: rhx grove.backup.restore --help

## --of with no org/repo pair
rc=2
✋ ConstraintError: --of takes <org/repo>, with one of --tree or --setaside beside it
   └─ e.g.: --of ahbode/svc-quotes --tree svc-quotes

## --home of a dir never backed up
rc=2
✋ ConstraintError: --home takes one of the backed-up home dirs: .claude · .rhachet
   └─ a clone or worktree takes --of and --tree

## --into with --all
rc=2
✋ ConstraintError: --into lays ONE unit aside; it does not combine with --all
   └─ drop --into, or name one unit in place of --all

## an unknown argument
rc=2
✋ ConstraintError: unknown argument '--bogus'
   └─ see: rhx grove.backup.restore --help

## --orphan with no org/dir pair
rc=2
✋ ConstraintError: --orphan takes <org>/<dir>
   └─ e.g.: --orphan ahbode/svc-quotes.feat-x

