## an archived unit past the 90-day reach
rc=2
🐢 lets carry grove-1's work home...

🗄️ grove.backup.restore --from grove-1 --orphan acme/widget.dropped --into <fixture>/aside/locked
   ├─ org=acme/orphan=widget.dropped · <date> · DEEP_ARCHIVE
   │  └─ ✋ ConstraintError: sits in DEEP_ARCHIVE, past this box's 90-day reach
   │     ├─ why: the grant locks a grove out of an archived object; the admin tier alone thaws it
   │     └─ fix: at the admin tier, thaw it; then this same command lays it, once it reads
   │        └─ aws s3api restore-object --bucket fixture-bucket --key 'grove=grove-1/user=<seat>/org=acme/orphan=widget.dropped/date=<date>.tar.gz' --restore-request '{"Days":7,"GlacierJobParameters":{"Tier":"Standard"}}'
   └─ 1 unit · 0 restored · 0 already here · 0 await a thaw · 1 refused · 0 failed

